        {
          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-912c49eb01b70c7d",
          "text": "Amazingly,the trees grow in such a way that their leaves and branches, although close together, never actually touch those of another tree.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2020-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2020年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新高考Ⅱ）英语试题",
