          "text": "Watching the monarch change their form also touched the men.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb",
            "paperTitle": "2023年2月四省联考英语",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2023-four-provinces-feb:reading-c",
