        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-febce3e509088466",
          "text": "The students took on diverse topics and turned in stories, 10 to 20 pages each, with characters that broadened my view and touched my heart.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
