            "start": 123,
            "end": 130
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-8f0ad7b6e8dae0ca",
          "text": "“I was incredibly touched that Andrew did something on that large of a scale, knowing what matters the most to me,” Jennifer says.",
