        {
          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-5a4070b1beba52b0",
          "text": "The next step, according to the researchers, is to try and work out whether the cockatoos rely entirely on visual clues（线索）, or also use a sense of touch in making their shape selections.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-national-a",
            "paperTitle": "2022年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（全国甲卷）",
