            "start": 148,
            "end": 153
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-95bef94689da4270",
          "text": "Research in the field of neuroplasticity-the brain’s adaptability-shows that the visual cortex(大脑皮层)is made active by touch.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2022-zhejiang-jun",
