          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-e12c7d228509fd2f",
          "text": "My wife suggested I get in touch with my brother, but I resisted, thinking he should call first.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
