        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:touch#e-490f1546380564a2",
          "text": "Plus, you will probably only get the numbers of the handful of students you'll actually keep in touch with.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-mock-chongqing-bashu-2026-10-first",
            "paperTitle": "重庆市巴蜀中学高2026届第一次质量检测",
